{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-plastics-rubber-fiber","title":"工程塑料、橡胶与纤维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/applications-frontiers/engineering-plastics-rubber-fiber","wordCount":1411,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"工程塑料-橡胶与纤维\">工程塑料、橡胶与纤维</h1><p>齿轮、轮胎、安全带——三件东西都是高分子，却没人会用做齿轮的材料去做轮胎，也没人会把轮胎橡胶纺成安全带。原因不在化学组成本身，而在三类材料对「室温下处于什么物理态」有截然不同的要求。塑料、橡胶、纤维这个产业上最基本的三分法，根子上就是<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">物理态</a>那一篇里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与结晶取向的不同组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三大类材料的本质区别在于室温相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的位置以及链的取向程度。<strong>塑料</strong>要求室温处于玻璃态或半结晶硬态（使用温度低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），具刚性与尺寸稳定性。**橡胶（弹性体）**要求室温处于橡胶态（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远低于室温）且经轻度交联以提供回弹的网络，靠<a href=\"../foundations/chain-conformation-statistics\">熵弹性</a>实现大变形可逆。<strong>纤维</strong>则是高结晶、高取向的线型高分子，沿轴向链高度伸直排列以获得高强高模。三者可来自同一类化学，差别在于链结构调控与加工取向。</p>\n<p>下图给出从物理态到三类材料的分野逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高分子链] --&gt; B{室温相对 Tg/Tm}&#10;  B --&gt;|室温 &lt; Tg 或半结晶硬态| C[塑料&lt;br/&gt;刚性 尺寸稳定]&#10;  B --&gt;|室温 &gt; Tg + 轻度交联| D[橡胶&lt;br/&gt;熵弹性 高回弹]&#10;  B --&gt;|高结晶 + 高取向| E[纤维&lt;br/&gt;高强高模]&#10;  C --&gt; F[通用塑料/工程塑料]&#10;  D --&gt; G[硫化网络]&#10;  E --&gt; H[纺丝拉伸取向]\">flowchart TD\n  A[高分子链] --&gt; B{室温相对 Tg/Tm}\n  B --&gt;|室温 &lt; Tg 或半结晶硬态| C[塑料&lt;br/&gt;刚性 尺寸稳定]\n  B --&gt;|室温 &gt; Tg + 轻度交联| D[橡胶&lt;br/&gt;熵弹性 高回弹]\n  B --&gt;|高结晶 + 高取向| E[纤维&lt;br/&gt;高强高模]\n  C --&gt; F[通用塑料/工程塑料]\n  D --&gt; G[硫化网络]\n  E --&gt; H[纺丝拉伸取向]</pre><p>三类材料的关键特征对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与室温</th>\n<th>结晶/交联</th>\n<th>力学特征</th>\n<th>代表材料</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>塑料</td>\n<td>室温 &lt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可结晶或非晶</td>\n<td>刚硬、抗变形</td>\n<td>PE、PP、PC、PA、POM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>橡胶</td>\n<td>室温 ≫ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻度交联</td>\n<td>高弹、可大变形</td>\n<td>NR、SBR、丁腈、硅橡胶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纤维</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>高结晶高取向</td>\n<td>高强高模</td>\n<td>涤纶、尼龙、芳纶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通用塑料与工程塑料\">通用塑料与工程塑料</h2><p>塑料按性能与价格分层。<strong>通用塑料</strong>——聚乙烯（PE）、聚丙烯（PP）、聚氯乙烯（PVC）、聚苯乙烯（PS）——产量巨大、价廉，用于包装、管材、日用品，合计占塑料产量的绝大部分。<strong>工程塑料</strong>——聚碳酸酯（PC）、聚酰胺（PA/尼龙）、聚甲醛（POM）、PET、ABS——力学、耐热、尺寸稳定性更优，可替代金属做结构件，如齿轮、汽车部件、电子外壳。再上是<strong>特种工程塑料</strong>——聚醚醚酮（PEEK）、聚酰亚胺（PI）、PTFE——耐高温（PEEK 长期使用温度可达 250°C 以上）、耐腐蚀，用于航空航天、医疗。性能逐级提升的代价是价格与加工难度上升，选材本质是在性能与成本间权衡，并以<a href=\"../structure-property/mechanical-rheological-properties\">力学流变性能</a>和热行为为判据。这些材料多由<a href=\"../polymerization/step-growth-polymerization\">逐步聚合</a>（聚酯、聚酰胺、PC）或<a href=\"../polymerization/chain-growth-polymerization\">配位/链式聚合</a>（聚烯烃）制得。</p>\n<h2 id=\"橡胶与硫化\">橡胶与硫化</h2><p>橡胶能拉长数倍又回弹，靠的是<a href=\"../foundations/chain-conformation-statistics\">构象熵弹性</a>，但未交联的生橡胶会发生不可逆的链滑移（蠕变、永久变形），所以必须<strong>硫化</strong>——用硫或其他交联剂在链间架起少量交联点，形成既能大变形又能回弹的三维网络。交联密度是关键旋钮：太低则强度不足、太高则失去弹性变硬变脆。天然橡胶（NR）回弹耐磨，丁苯橡胶（SBR）是合成橡胶主力、用于轮胎，丁腈橡胶（NBR）耐油，硅橡胶耐高低温且生物相容。橡胶常用炭黑等填料补强，显著提升强度与耐磨。交联网络的不可熔特性虽带来优异性能，却使其难以热塑回收——这一回收难题与解法见<a href=\"degradable-circular-polymers\">可降解与循环高分子</a>，而热塑性弹性体（TPE）正是用物理交联（嵌段共聚的微相分离）替代化学交联以实现可回收，其合成依赖<a href=\"../polymerization/copolymerization-controlled-radical\">嵌段共聚</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纤维与取向强化\">纤维与取向强化</h2><p>纤维的高强度来自两件事：高结晶度与高轴向取向。纺丝时熔体或溶液被挤出成丝，随后的**拉伸（牵伸）**让无规线团沿纤维轴伸直排列，链方向的共价键与紧密堆砌共同承载，强度因而远超同种材料的块体。涤纶（PET 纤维）、尼龙纤维兼具强度与弹性回复，用于服装与工业；<strong>芳纶</strong>（如 Kevlar）因刚性棒状链与液晶纺丝形成近乎完美的取向，比强度超过钢，用于防弹与高性能复合材料；超高分子量聚乙烯（UHMWPE）纤维同理。纤维性能是<a href=\"../foundations/chain-conformation-statistics\">链结构</a>、<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">结晶取向</a>与加工三者协同的极致体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复合材料与填料改性\">复合材料与填料改性</h2><p>单一高分子常难同时满足强度、刚度、耐热等要求，于是把高分子作<strong>基体</strong>、与增强相复合。玻璃纤维、碳纤维增强的<a href=\"../polymerization/step-growth-polymerization\">热固性树脂</a>（环氧、不饱和聚酯）兼具轻质与高强，广泛用于风电叶片、汽车、航空。纳米填料（纳米黏土、碳纳米管、石墨烯）少量添加即可大幅改善力学、阻隔与导电性能。填料还用于降本、阻燃、着色。复合化把高分子从单一材料拓展为可定制的材料体系，但也给末端回收带来挑战——纤维增强复合材料的分离回收正是当前难点，见<a href=\"degradable-circular-polymers\">循环高分子</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>下图汇总三大材料类别的核心：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[结构材料] --&gt; B[塑料&lt;br/&gt;室温硬态]&#10;  A --&gt; C[橡胶&lt;br/&gt;硫化交联熵弹性]&#10;  A --&gt; D[纤维&lt;br/&gt;高结晶高取向]&#10;  B --&gt; E[通用→工程→特种]&#10;  C --&gt; F[TPE 物理交联可回收]&#10;  A --&gt; G[复合材料/填料改性]&#10;  G --&gt; H[回收难题]\">flowchart TD\n  A[结构材料] --&gt; B[塑料&lt;br/&gt;室温硬态]\n  A --&gt; C[橡胶&lt;br/&gt;硫化交联熵弹性]\n  A --&gt; D[纤维&lt;br/&gt;高结晶高取向]\n  B --&gt; E[通用→工程→特种]\n  C --&gt; F[TPE 物理交联可回收]\n  A --&gt; G[复合材料/填料改性]\n  G --&gt; H[回收难题]</pre><ul>\n<li>塑料/橡胶/纤维三分法的本质是室温相对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的位置与链取向不同，源自<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">物理态</a>。</li>\n<li>塑料按通用→工程→特种分层，性能与成本同步上升，PEEK/PI 等耐高温用于航空医疗。</li>\n<li>橡胶靠<strong>硫化</strong>交联获得熵弹性网络，交联密度是核心旋钮；TPE 用物理交联实现可回收。</li>\n<li>纤维靠高结晶+高轴向取向获得高强高模，芳纶比强度超钢。</li>\n<li>复合材料与填料把高分子拓展为可定制体系，但增加回收难度，对接<a href=\"degradable-circular-polymers\">循环高分子</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工程塑料、橡胶与纤维","id":"工程塑料-橡胶与纤维"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"通用塑料与工程塑料","id":"通用塑料与工程塑料"},{"level":2,"text":"橡胶与硫化","id":"橡胶与硫化"},{"level":2,"text":"纤维与取向强化","id":"纤维与取向强化"},{"level":2,"text":"复合材料与填料改性","id":"复合材料与填料改性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高分子表征（GPC·DSC·光散射）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/structure-property/polymer-characterization"},"next":{"title":"功能高分子与生物医用材料","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/applications-frontiers/functional-biomedical-polymers"}}